	<div class="inner col col24 first last id71dac11c-e362-409f-9060-cb0856811e99" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="71dac11c-e362-409f-9060-cb0856811e99">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditorddcae956-9aea-44c7-8340-741f62132c02" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 class="subhead1">Fire and Life Safety permits</h2><p>The Fire and Life Safety Division page is currently being updated. We appreciate your patience during this process.&nbsp;</p><h3 class="subhead2">Codes&nbsp;</h3><p>CRFD is currently utilizing the following adopted codes:</p><ul><li>2024 International Fire Code, as adopted by the Town of Castle Rock&nbsp;</li><li><a href="https://library.municode.com/co/castle_rock/codes/municipal_code?nodeId=TIT15BUCOPUIM_ARTIIBUCO_CH15.18INFICO" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CRFD-adopted amendments to the IFC&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</li></ul><p>These codes and standards govern our fire prevention, inspection and plan review processes. Please ensure compliance in all applicable enforcement and operational activities.</p><h3 class="subhead2">Permits and applications</h3><ul><li><a href="http://crfdfm.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Permitting for construction, operation and life safety systems</a></li><li><a href="http://crfdfm.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Mobile Food Vendor application Opens in new window">Mobile Food Vendor application</a></li><li><a href="http://crfdfm.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Operational Special event permit application</a> (i.e., bounce house, tent, carnival / fair, exhibit, tradeshow, etc.)</li></ul><h3 class="subhead2">Blasting requirements</h3><ul><li><a aria-label="CRFD Blasting Requirements (PDF) Opens in new window" href="/DocumentCenter/View/40691" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CRFD Blasting Requirements (PDF)</a></li><li><a aria-label="CRFD Blast Report Fillable form (PDF) Opens in new window" href="/DocumentCenter/View/40690" rel="noopener" target="_blank">CRFD Blast Report fillable form (PDF)</a></li></ul><h3 class="subhead2">For more information on:</h3><ul><li>Fire and Life Safety applications</li><li>Development and construction&nbsp;</li><li>Environmental assessment report</li><li>HAZMAT chemical reporting&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Please <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b5f3e5faf5d6c7d2dac39bd6dad8">email the Fire and Life Safety Division</a>, or call 303-663-3120. &nbsp;</p><p>If you are unable to access any portion of the documents on this page due to a disability as defined under <a href="https://oit.colorado.gov/hb21-1110-faq" id="isPasted">Colorado House Bill 21-1110</a>, we are here to help! Please call us at 303-663-4440, <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e68785858395958f848f8a8f929fa6a5b4818990c885898b">email the Town&rsquo;s accessibility team</a> or <a href="https://www.crgov.com/FormCenter/Facilities-and-ADA-Compliance-75/Website-Accessibility-Request-Form-613">submit an accommodation request form</a>.</p>
    </div>

